# Moire

Read `AGENTS.md` before changing renderer, inverse math, or HUD.

- Keep CPU (`inverseCpu.ts`) and WGSL (`inverse.wgsl.ts`) twins. One `fn` per `wgslFn`.
- Rotation needs an `n` sweep; do not cap rings. Holes at zoom-out are missed sides.
- Do not rebuild `colorNode` when layer count changes. Fixed `MAX_LAYERS` slots.
- World Y up; flip Y only in `camera.ts`. `rotation` is degrees, `rotationOffset` is radians.
- One left `Studio` chrome (logo, view, layers, fields). `I` collapses it. No separate HUD / inspector / filmstrip.
- Default background is white. Lines icon is `EqualSignIcon`.
- Do not resurrect `maxRings`, Option-key modes, JSON import, or fake blends.
